@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml

title Auth - Logout

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityFontName Arial
skinparam activityFontSize 14
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  DiamondBorderColor #2563EB
  StartColor #111827
  EndColor #FFFFFF
}

|Customer|
start
note right
Precondition:
The user is authenticated and holds a valid
refresh token.

Postcondition:
The refresh token is revoked. The current
access token expires naturally.
end note
:Choose to log out;
:Submit the logout request with the refresh token;
|System|
if (The system fails while processing the request?) then (Yes)
  :Return the system error;
  |Customer|
  :View the system error;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Identify the caller from the access token;
if (The access token is missing or expired?) then (Yes)
  :Return the authentication-required error;
  |Customer|
  :View the authentication-required error;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Check the refresh token exists, is active
and belongs to the caller;
if (The refresh token is not valid for the caller?) then (Yes)
  :Return the invalid-refresh-token error;
  |Customer|
  :View the invalid-refresh-token error;
  stop
else (No)
  |System|
  :Revoke the refresh token;
  :Return the logout result;
  |Customer|
  :View the logout result;
  stop
endif

@enduml
